.claude/
coverage/

# ─── CFAI Gold Standards — internal IP (DO NOT publish) ──────────────
# Adapted reckoners under docs/standards/ are Context First AI internal
# reference material — a build INPUT, not a deliverable (think node_modules).
# Reconstitute them from cfai-manifest.json (committed at the repo root):
#   python3 adopt.py --project . --repo <gold-standards-repo-url>
# NOTE: ignore the CONTENTS (docs/standards/*), not the directory itself —
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so the
# README signpost below would be lost if this were `docs/standards/`.
docs/standards/*
!docs/standards/README.md

# ASC API key / signing secrets — never commit
/credentials/
